Every company, vendor, bank, tax id, invoice, purchase order and amount in this
repository is invented for the demo. The coffee roastery and its vendors are
generated from a fixed seed in src/ledger_desk/company.py; the tax ids start
with 00, a prefix the IRS does not issue (inferred, not checked against an IRS
list). The sample invoices in invoices/ and the eval cases in evals/ were
written for the demo, and the replies in replays/ are recorded runs of Claude
on those invoices.

The industry figures the page quotes belong to their publishers and are quoted
with a link to each: Ardent Partners, "The State of ePayables 2025"; the
Association for Financial Professionals, "2025 Payments Fraud and Control
Survey"; and the FBI Internet Crime Complaint Center's 2024 report, as quoted
by Nacha.

